<title>USA: LDC debt trading closed in U.S. for Veterans Day.</title>
<headline>LDC debt trading closed in U.S. for Veterans Day.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading of emerging market debts was closed in the U.S. for Veterans Day holiday on Monday.</p>
<p>When trading resumes on Tuesday, the market is expected to focus on the Russian Eurobond, as top Russian financial officials make their cases in a roadshow.</p>
<p>On Friday, an International Monetary Fund team arrives in Caracas to review Venezuelan economic reform program. Brazil's second round of municipal elections also takes place Friday.</p>
<p>Over the weekend, possibly on Saturday, the Ecuadorian government may unveil its long-awaited economic program.</p>
<p>-- N.A Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
